      <div><p class="mp-kicker">Corporate LiveWire · Global Awards 2026/27</p><p class="clw-publisher">CallTeam company announcement · <time datetime="2026-11-03">3 November 2026</time></p><h1>CallTeam wins<br><span>Business-to-Business Sales Specialists of the Year.</span></h1><p class="clw-lead">B2B sales expertise. Built around your buyers.</p><p>Corporate LiveWire has named CallTeam its Business-to-Business Sales Specialists of the Year in the Global Awards 2026/27. This fourth award adds to our recognition for outbound calling, lead generation, appointment setting and global B2B sales execution.</p><p>We help founders and revenue teams reach relevant buyers, qualify interest and give sellers a clear next step. Explore the recognition and the work behind our service.</p><div class="mp-actions"><a class="mp-button" href="#campaign-results" data-award-action="proof">See the Campaign Results ↓</a><a class="mp-text-link" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="hero">Discuss Your Sales Campaign ↗</a></div></div>
