  <section class="mp-section" id="the-award"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">01 / B2B sales recognition</p><h2>Recognised for<br>specialist B2B sales expertise.</h2><p>The award names the discipline at the centre of CallTeam’s work: helping businesses sell to other businesses. Our managed outbound service connects buyer research, live conversations, follow-up and qualification.</p><p>Corporate LiveWire confirmed CallTeam’s selection on 3 November 2026 and supplied the official 2026/27 winner’s badge. It is our fourth award across B2B calling, lead generation, appointment setting and sales execution.</p><p>For a prospective client, the next step is to look at how that work is delivered. Our <a href="/about/">company background</a>, <a href="/case-studies/">published campaign examples</a> and <a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">free sales resources</a> make the approach easy to explore.</p></div><aside class="mp-note"><p class="mp-label">About the organiser</p><h3>Corporate LiveWire<br>Global Awards.</h3><p>The programme considers supporting information from nominees alongside publicly available research. Corporate LiveWire lists service excellence, marketing and branding, industry recognition, ethical practice and employee satisfaction among its judging criteria.</p><p>The organiser describes its awards process on the official programme website.</p><a href="{{ corporateLivewire.sourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore the Official Awards Programme ↗</a></aside></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="sales-expertise"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="clw-intro"><p class="mp-kicker">02 / The service behind the recognition</p><h2>Know the buyer.<br>Earn the conversation.<br>Qualify the next step.</h2><p>A strong B2B sales campaign starts with a specific offer and a relevant audience. We agree whom to approach, the problem worth discussing and what a useful meeting should achieve before the calling begins.</p></div><div class="clw-process"><article><span class="mp-step">01 / Research</span><h3>Build around the buying decision.</h3><p>Choose target accounts and the roles connected to the problem. Prepare contact records and an opening that gives the buyer a reason to listen. AI-assisted research supports account preparation and prioritisation.</p><a href="/services/b2b-lead-generation/" data-award-action="service">Explore B2B Lead Generation →</a></article><article><span class="mp-step">02 / Conversation</span><h3>Let experienced people lead.</h3><p>Human callers introduce the offer, ask useful questions, hear objections and follow up with context. Buyer responses help refine the targeting and message as the campaign develops.</p><a href="/human-led-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="service">See Human-Led Appointment Setting →</a></article><article><span class="mp-step">03 / Qualification</span><h3>Give sales a reason to continue.</h3><p>Assess the conversation against agreed criteria. Record the buyer’s need, relevant context and next step, then hand the discussion to the client’s team for discovery and progression.</p><a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="service">Explore Appointment Setting →</a></article></div><div class="clw-experience-wrap"><p class="mp-label">The combined experience behind CallTeam</p><div class="clw-experience" aria-label="The combined experience behind CallTeam"><div><strong>500,000+</strong><span>outbound calls</span></div><div><strong>1,000+</strong><span>sellers coached</span></div><div><strong>150+</strong><span>companies supported</span></div><div><strong>Fortune<br>100 / 500</strong><span>sales environments</span></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section clw-proof" id="campaign-results"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">03 / Published client campaigns</p><h2>Recognition matters.<br>So does the work.</h2><p>These separate campaigns show how buyer research, relevant outreach and qualification translate into reported sales activity. Read each case for the audience, approach and outcome.</p></div><div class="clw-proof-grid"><article><p class="mp-label">B2B SaaS</p><strong class="clw-proof-number">11</strong><h3>qualified demos<br>in 90 days.</h3><p>Four sales opportunities developed from the campaign. Two customers signed within six months.</p><a href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="proof">Read the SaaS Case Study →</a></article><article><p class="mp-label">Manufacturing cybersecurity</p><strong class="clw-proof-number">9</strong><h3>qualified appointments<br>in 90 days.</h3><p>Three conversations progressed into sales opportunities with manufacturing buyers.</p><a href="/case-studies/manufacturing-cybersecurity-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="proof">Read the Cybersecurity Case Study →</a></article><article><p class="mp-label">HR software</p><strong class="clw-proof-number">9</strong><h3>booked product demos<br>in 90 days.</h3><p>Two proposals were recorded in the same first 90-day campaign period.</p><a href="/case-studies/hr-software-lead-generation/" data-award-action="proof">Read the HR Software Case Study →</a></article></div><p class="clw-proof-note">Figures describe the individual engagements linked above. Meeting definitions and reporting periods belong to each campaign. Client identities are confidential.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section" id="sales-handoff"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">04 / What reaches your sales team</p><h2>A meeting with context.<br>A useful next conversation.</h2><p>Your sellers need to know why someone agreed to meet. CallTeam’s qualification and handoff connect the appointment to the buyer’s situation, so the next conversation can pick up where the outreach ended.</p><p>We agree the campaign scope, responsibilities, qualification criteria and reporting before launch. Your team leads discovery, proposals and closing. Our <a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/" data-award-action="service">outsourced SDR service</a> provides managed support across the prospecting and qualification work.</p><p>Use the <a href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/" data-award-action="tool">Meeting Quality Check</a> to follow your own appointments through held meetings, accepted opportunities and the stages your team tracks.</p></div><aside class="clw-handoff"><p class="mp-kicker">The handoff should answer</p><h3>Why this buyer.<br>Why this conversation.</h3><ul><li><strong>Who is involved?</strong>The company, contact and role connected to the business issue.</li><li><strong>What matters to them?</strong>The need or workflow discussed, relevant objections and useful buyer context.</li><li><strong>What happens next?</strong>The reason to meet, agreed next step and information your seller needs.</li></ul><p>Qualification is agreed for your offer and market. A calendar booking is one stage in the sales process.</p></aside></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="sales-resources"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">05 / Expertise you can explore</p><h2>Practical sales knowledge.<br>Open to your team.</h2><p>CallTeam shares 100 free calling-script resources and 138 outbound sales guides, with industry playbooks, buyer guidance, objection responses and planning tools.</p><p>Use the library to prepare an opening, understand a buying role or plan qualification questions. It gives founders and sales teams practical help they can apply before choosing managed support.</p><a class="mp-text-link" href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Explore the Free Outbound Sales Library →</a></div><div class="clw-library-links"><a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/">100 Free Cold-Call Script Resources →</a><a href="/resources/outbound-playbooks/industries/">Industry Playbooks →</a><a href="/resources/outbound-playbooks/buyers/">Buyer Playbooks →</a><a href="/articles/cold-call-objection-handling/">Objection-Handling Guidance →</a><a href="/resources/outbound-campaign-strategy/">Qualification and Campaign Strategy →</a><a href="/services/sdr-training/" data-award-action="service">SDR Training and Sales Coaching →</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section" id="other-awards"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">06 / Four CallTeam recognitions</p><h2>Awards across the work<br>that builds B2B pipeline.</h2><p>The Corporate LiveWire win joins three existing recognitions. Explore each announcement for its awarded title, issuer and edition.</p></div><div class="clw-other-awards">{% for key, item in awards %}{% if key != 'corporatelivewire' %}<article><a href="{{ item.url }}" data-award-key="{{ key }}" data-award-placement="corporate-livewire-related" aria-label="Read CallTeam’s {{ item.programme }} award announcement"><img{% if item.imageKind == 'programme' %} class="clw-programme-mark"{% endif %} src="{{ item.image }}" width="{{ item.imageWidth or item.size }}" height="{{ item.imageHeight or item.size }}" alt="{{ item.label }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div><p class="mp-label">{{ item.programme }} · {{ item.edition }}</p><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.summary }}</p></div><a class="clw-read-award" href="{{ item.url }}" data-award-key="{{ key }}" data-award-placement="corporate-livewire-related">Read the {{ item.announcementLabel }} Announcement →</a></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><p><a class="mp-text-link" href="/awards/" data-award-action="recognition">Explore All CallTeam Awards and Recognition →</a></p></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="services"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">07 / Put the expertise to work</p><h2>Build the sales support<br>your team needs.</h2><p>Choose the work you want managed and the markets you need to reach. We will define the research, outreach, qualification and reporting around your campaign.</p></div><div class="clw-services"><a href="/services/b2b-cold-calling/" data-award-action="service"><strong>B2B outbound calling</strong><span>Human conversations, relevant questions and follow-up with decision-makers.</span></a><a href="/services/b2b-lead-generation/" data-award-action="service"><strong>B2B lead generation</strong><span>Target-account research, contact preparation and outreach to suitable buyers.</span></a><a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="service"><strong>B2B appointment setting</strong><span>Qualification, booking and the buyer context your sales team needs.</span></a><a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/" data-award-action="service"><strong>Outsourced SDR services</strong><span>A managed prospecting and qualification function for your B2B offer.</span></a></div><div class="mp-tool-band"><div><h3>See a starting plan for your market.</h3><p>Explore your offer, buyers and opening approach in the campaign planner. Review <a href="/pricing/" data-award-action="service">CallTeam’s pricing</a> for starting scope and budget.</p></div><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/" data-award-action="tool">See How We’d Run Your Campaign ↗</a></div></div></section>
